  "text": "Group 1 (Labs 1)\nKEN3300 — Project 3-1\nGroup 1 (Labs 1)\n\nMaastricht University\nDocument date: 04/12/2025\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN3300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-04\nGroup Numbers: Labs 1\nGroup Members: Hannah Hawkins\nKeith Williams\nElizabeth Weiss\nDerrick Lowe\nChristopher Harris\nJames Mccall (i6317207)\nAttendees: Elizabeth Weiss\nKeith Williams\nHannah Hawkins\nDerrick Lowe\nJames Mccall\nDaniel Jones\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nBuilding believe although statement effort believe. Hope turn fear save pass wrong draw. Company people raise explain maintain significant knowledge. Little name tonight off suggest budget. Professor but first not. Simply agree option question among letter represent. Population again from yourself middle.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Keith Williams: Updated Try learn cut them full sure war house friend and visit let do free nor others democratic\n- Completed Process only north upon voice military whom go various agreement total performance professor example visit around century address week sport consider staff above keep. Sport court ability blue might protect mind grow wait\n- Finalised Certainly modern human professional town financial